# Probes of RimBank.Host. Run the AppHost (dotnet run --project src/RimBank.AppHost) and set @host to the
# rimbank-host URL shown in the Aspire dashboard. Both probes are anonymous and return the status only.
@host = http://localhost:5100

### Readiness: every health check must pass
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness: only checks tagged "live"
GET {{host}}/alive

### Problem Details (ADR 0015): no endpoint matches, so the host answers 404 application/problem+json:
# {
#   "type": "urn:rimbank:problem:shared:not-found",
#   "title": "Not Found",
#   "status": 404,
#   "detail": "No resource exists at this address.",
#   "instance": "/PartyReferenceDataDirectory/does-not-exist/Retrieve",
#   "errorCode": "shared.not-found",
#   "traceId": "<32 hex characters, the trace shown in the Aspire dashboard>"
# }
GET {{host}}/PartyReferenceDataDirectory/does-not-exist/Retrieve
